  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1dc66e9658df9284f81f0664a7ee2889, type: 3}
  m_Name: Irene+PenelopeMediationCollectible
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CollectableEntries
  entryTitle: A Note from Penelope (Mediation)
  description: 
  neutralDescription: "What\u2019s up with Irene today? I get wanting to be safe,
    but did she have to be so rude? Granted, I wasn\u2019t perfect either. I need
    to try and be less reactive. I\u2019m sure things will be fine later, I\u2019ll
    focus on getting through the foggy forest for now."
  negativeDescription: "\u2026Did that just happen? I can\u2019t believe Irene, my
    best friend, would say such nasty things to me. I get it, it could be dangerous,
    but loosen up! The FOMO is gonna lead to me wrapping myself around a tree, what
    the f*#%?! She can be stuck up, sure, but she\u2019s rarely ever that mean. Whatever,
    she can stay at home bored while I make memories I\u2019ll look back on fondly."
  positiveDescription: "I\u2019m a little sad that Irene doesn\u2019t want to come
    to the party in the forest with me, but I can see why. The fog is kinda menacing,
    but I\u2019m sure I\u2019ll be fine if I\u2019m careful. One day, Irene will
    see there\u2019s more to life than playing Critter Camping till the morning.
    Till then, forest party, here I come!"
